@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@receptionistToken = replace-with-receptionist-jwt
@managerToken = replace-with-manager-jwt
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-jwt
@housekeeperToken = replace-with-housekeeper-jwt

### 1. Receptionist xem danh sách khách đến hôm nay
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}

### 2. Phân trang tùy chỉnh
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today?page=1&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}

### 3. Thiếu access token - kỳ vọng 401 AUTH_UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today

### 4. Housekeeper không có quyền - kỳ vọng 403 AUTH_FORBIDDEN
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today
Authorization: Bearer {{housekeeperToken}}

### 5. Page không hợp lệ - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today?page=-1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}

### 6. Size vượt giới hạn - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today?page=0&size=101
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}

### 7. Manager được phép truy cập - kỳ vọng 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### 8. Admin được phép truy cập - kỳ vọng 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Page sai kiểu - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today?page=abc&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}

### 10. Size bằng 0 - kỳ vọng 400 VALIDATION_FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/front-desk/arrivals/today?page=0&size=0
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}
